CHAPTER.VERS:
And the king said, What have I to do with you

          {+}
        , you

          {+}
         sons of Zeruiah? Because he curses, and because Yahweh has said to him, Curse David; who then will say, Why have you done so?

Then Absalom said to Ahithophel, Give your

          {+}
         counsel what we will do.
